The '''Stone Valley''', also known as '''Stone Canyon''', was a location on the [[planet]] [[Aldhani]].<ref name="Aldhani" /> In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">"Aldhani" takes place in between "[[Kassa (episode)|Kassa]]," which dates itself to [[5 BBY]], and "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," which {{SW|url=andor-s1-e8-trivia-gallery|text="Narkina 5" Trivia Gallery &#124; Andor}} {{C|Slide 6}} dates to 5 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|BBY]].</ref> during the preparations for [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Colonel]] [[Soden Petigar|Petigar's]] arrival to the [[Aldhani dam]], groups working under [[Lieutenant]] [[Gorn]] were tasked with mapping a trek along the Valley in order to facilitate his planning a new planetary [[airbase]]. During the operations, pairs of [[TIE/ln space superiority starfighter|TIE/ln starfighters]] from the [[Alkenzi Air Base]] were dispatched to the Valley to patrol for intruders and assist the mappers. Meanwhile, as the rebel [[Vel Sartha]] trekked across the hills of Aldhani to meet with the rebel leader [[Luthen Rael]], Sartha's journey was lengthened to be a full [[Standard day|day]] due to avoiding the Imperial patrols in the Stone Valley.<ref name="Aldhani" />

